---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = "About";
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <h1>about</h1>

  <p>
    I'm Artur, based in Brazil. My day job is IT support, help desk work,
    and most of what pulls my attention sits around networks and, lately,
    cybersecurity.
  </p>

  <p>
    Away from that, I'm teaching myself to build for the web. This site is
    the practice ground: I put it together myself and keep changing it. I will
    write down what I learn on the <a href="/blog/">blog</a>.
  </p>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
